body:
`opened` is line-aligned, but `finished`, `n_units` and the start of `unit_start` share its line. So the helpers polling `opened` take invalidations from main's cut writes and from the other helpers' `finished` increments. Same reasoning as the comment above `next_unit`.

```suggestion
    // Helpers done with the open window. Not on the line the helpers poll.
    alignas(cache_line_size) std::atomic<uint32_t> finished{0};
```

