This says every pair row "is written whole", but the sentence covers partial blocks too, and those use masked stores.

```suggestion
//      block, 1 KiB) is written whole for a full block; a partial block
//      writes only the present tokens' lanes with a masked store
//      (store_block). A run of one
```

Checked by: `sed -n 714,716p h/tron/models/kv_cache.hpp` and `sed -n 363p h/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp` -> "is written whole (store_block)" against `_mm512_mask_storeu_epi32(..., present, r[dp])` in the partial branch.

